2. **Depth and Comprehensiveness**: The golden standard provides:
   - A detailed table/matrix showing both cases
   - Multiple alternative formulations of the question
   - Explanation of why the solution is ""elegant"" and ""robust""
   - Discussion of the ""self-referential question"" technique as a general pattern
   - More thorough verification with visual formatting
   - Discussion of why this approach is superior to other methods

3. **Structure and Presentation**: The golden standard uses:
   - Better visual organization (tables, code blocks)
