   - Discussion of alternative phrasings
   - Explicit reasoning about why the method is general and doesn't require knowing which guard is which

4. **Pedagogical Value**: The golden standard goes beyond just solving the puzzle—it explains:
   - The general principle of ""double inversion""
   - Why this is an elegant solution
   - How the technique generalizes
   - Alternative formulations that also work

### Quality Assessment

