| Visual aids | ✗ None | ✓ Table + formatting |
| Misconception discussion | ✗ Brief | ✓ Detailed |
| Generalization | ✗ No | ✓ Yes (n doors) |
| Empirical verification | ✗ No | ✓ Mentioned |
| Language | English | German |

## Overall Assessment

The model response is **mathematically sound and correctly answers the question**. It demonstrates proper understanding of conditional probability and Bayes' theorem. However, it is **less comprehensive and pedagogically rich** than the golden standard. The golden standard provides multiple angles of explanation (mathematical, intuitive, case-based, generalized) with better formatting and more thorough coverage of why the answer is correct and why common misconceptions arise.

