**Standard Adherence (2/5):**
- The model's response is roughly 40% as comprehensive as the golden standard
- Missing 5 of 8 identified problems
- Missing 3 of 6 psychological principles with citations
- Missing narrative structure analysis
- Missing validation metrics
- The golden standard is ""expert-level UX writing""; the model is ""competent practitioner-level""",,True,17322.725542006083,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,3.0,3.0,2.0,,hybrid,,10.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
