  - `aria-label` examples
  - Screen reader verbalization issues (e.g., ""✓"" not read aloud)
  - Icon-reference fragility (""Tippen Sie auf '+'"" is not accessible)

**6. Tone-of-Voice & Empathy (Moderate Gap)**
- Model: Addresses tone briefly (""Positiver, weniger alarmierender Ton"")
- Golden: Deeper analysis with psychological impact (e.g., ""Schuldzuweisung kann bei chronisch Kranken Scham auslösen"")
- Model misses: Specific elderly user considerations, adherence psychology

**7. Button Semantics & UX Patterns (Moderate Gap)**
