## Scoring Considerations

**Task Compliance (0-5):**
- The model completed all required sections (problem analysis, improved guide, justification)
- However, the problem analysis is less comprehensive (9 vs. 20 problems)
- The improved SETUP.md is good but missing some details from the golden standard
