3. **Preview-Text Length**: Model's preview text is ~100 characters vs. the 50-character target (though this is less critical than subject line).
4. **Body Length**: Model's body is ~180 words vs. 200-300 target.
5. **CTA Specificity**: Model's CTA lacks the ""reason-to-click"" element specified in requirements.

---

## Strengths of Model Response

