1. Explicit hypothesis testing (what to rule out)
2. Measurement gap closure as the first step
3. Specific tools and technologies
4. Prioritized action plan (immediate → short-term → long-term)
5. Complementary frontend optimizations

The model provides a solid answer but misses these nuances that would make it more actionable and comprehensive.",,True,12151.04962499754,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,4.0,4.0,3.0,0.0,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,24.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,20.0/100,,,10.0/100,,,,,,,,,,
