   - Golden standard cites **6 specific psychological theories** with academic references (Nunes & Drèze 2006, Sweller 1988, Kahneman 1993, Deci & Ryan, Zajonc 1968, Thaler & Sunstein)
   - Model mentions 3 principles (Progressive Disclosure, Endowed Progress Effect, Alltagssprache) without citations
   - Golden standard provides detailed explanations of *why* each principle applies
   - Model provides brief justifications

3. **Optimization Depth:**
   - Golden standard includes **word count targets** (≤35, ≤35, ≤40 words per step)
   - Golden standard provides **specific UI patterns** (e.g., ""Schritt überspringen →"" button, dynamic summary ""Wenn X, dann Y"")
