   The model response provides only a primary CTA and basic trust elements.

5. **Risk Reversal Depth**: The golden standard lists three specific risk reversals (14 Tage free, Keine Kreditkarte, Setup in unter 10 Minuten). The model mentions ""14 Tage risikofrei"" but doesn't elaborate on the other friction points.

6. **Explanatory Depth**: The golden standard includes 6 detailed justifications explaining *why* each choice works (e.g., ""Eine emotionale Headline erzeugt 3× mehr Aufmerksamkeit""). The model provides no meta-explanation.

7. **Complete Hero-Section Mockup**: The golden standard shows a full visual layout of the complete hero section. The model provides individual components but not an integrated view.

