- **Standard Adherence (3/5)**: Covers ~60-70% of the golden standard's depth. Missing diagnostic table, feature-benefit mapping, secondary CTA, visual layout, and justifications

**Overall Score: 4/5** – Good response that meets core requirements but misses secondary elements and structural depth compared to the golden standard.",,True,17994.965125006274,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,4.0,4.0,3.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
