The response would be acceptable as a **basic release notes template** but falls short of the **comprehensive, methodology-driven analysis** the golden standard demonstrates. The gap is particularly severe in the problem identification phase, which is foundational to the entire task.",,True,35553.588624999975,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,2.0,3.0,2.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
