**Tone:** Professional and solution-oriented throughout. Sarcasm completely removed.

**Completeness:** Covers the essential elements (issues, root cause, recommendation, next steps) but lacks the structural polish and metadata of the golden standard.

**Executive Readability:** Good but not optimal. The prose-heavy format requires more reading effort than the golden standard's structured approach.

## Sub-Score Justification

