**Standard Adherence (3/5):** The model response addresses the core content requirements but falls short on the structural and formatting expectations demonstrated in the golden standard. Missing metadata block, severity classification, explicit CTA, and optimized scannability are notable gaps. The golden standard shows a more sophisticated understanding of executive communication norms.

## Overall Assessment

