**Authenticity:** The output is *partially* authentic to Berlin agency tone. It removes some buzzwords but doesn't fully embrace the anti-corporate, minimalist aesthetic of the golden standard.

**Completeness:** The response is complete as a rewrite, but incomplete in capturing the full stylistic requirements.

## Overall Evaluation

