The response demonstrates understanding of the task but doesn't fully achieve the target tone. It's a **good attempt** that meets basic requirements but misses the stylistic nuances that make the golden standard exceptional.",,True,11759.807958995225,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,5.0,3.0,2.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,100/100,100/100
