The model response addresses all three requirements. It correctly identifies the database CPU utilization as the bottleneck and provides reasoning and solutions.

### Comparison with Golden Standard

**Strengths of the Model Response:**
- Correctly identifies database CPU at 99-100% as the primary bottleneck
