- ❌ Missing critical ARIA attributes (`aria-pressed`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-atomic`, `aria-relevant`)
- ✅ Testing checklist present (but less detailed)
- ❌ No framework/mnemonic provided

### 4. **Specific Technical Gaps**

| Element | Golden Standard | Model Response | Gap Severity |
|---------|-----------------|-----------------|--------------|
