| Dropdown | `<label class=""sr-only"">` + `aria-expanded` + `aria-haspopup` | Only `aria-label` + context | **Critical** |
| Search | `<search role=""search"">` + scope details | Only `aria-label` | **High** |
| Dark Mode | `aria-pressed=""false/true""` + JS guidance | Only label with state text | **Critical** |
| Pagination | Dynamic page numbers + `<nav>` wrapper | Static label | **High** |
| Live-Ticker | `aria-atomic=""false""` + `aria-relevant=""additions""` | Only `aria-live=""polite""` | **Critical** |

### 5. **Tone & Presentation**

- ✅ Professional, clear German
- ✅ Well-organized
- ⚠️ Less authoritative than golden standard (no WCAG citations, no F.I.R.S.T. framework)
- ⚠️ Additional hints section is helpful but generic (not tailored to the specific elements)

