**Gap:** The model uses generic transitions (""Aber wait"", ""Stell dir vor"") rather than specific, personal open loops that create genuine curiosity. The golden standard's loops are more sophisticated and psychologically targeted.

### 5. QUOTABLE ONE-LINERS / RETWEET OPTIMIZATION

