## Comparison to Golden Standard

| Criterion | Model Response | Golden Standard | Gap |
|-----------|---|---|---|
| Problems Identified | 11 | 19 | -8 (42% incomplete) |
| Critical Issues Found | 1 | 4 | -3 |
| High Issues Found | 3 | 5 | -2 |
| Problem Matrix Format | Bullet list | Detailed table | Structural difference |
