   - Golden standard's ""In 30 Minuten erinnern"" is more concrete and reassuring
   - Model's ""Einnahme vergessen"" still uses ""verpasst"" language; golden standard eliminates this entirely (""noch nicht eingenommen"")

6. **Terminology Consistency:**
   - Model provides basic glossary at end (""Hinweise zur Konsistenz"")
   - Golden standard provides comprehensive **Wording-Konsistenz-Glossar** with ✅/❌ columns and medical reasoning
