- Table of contents
- Quick Start block ✓
- Prerequisites with version matrix ✓
- Repository cloning ✓
- Project structure & services ✓
- .env configuration ✓
- Service startup ✓
- Database initialization ✓
- Setup validation ✓
- Stop/reset instructions ✓
- Troubleshooting (7 problems) ✓
- Next steps ✓

**Quality Assessment:**

*Strengths:*
- All major sections present and well-organized
- Prerequisites section includes version matrix, OS-specific installation, and a copy-pasteable check script
- .env template is comprehensive with clear comments and Docker service name explanation
- Troubleshooting covers 7 common issues (exceeds the 5+ requirement)
