| Migration guide | Bash commands + examples | Bash commands + examples | ✓ |
| Persona-based navigation | Quick nav table | Implicit in structure | Model exceeds |
| Release summary | Present | Present | ✓ |
| Links to docs | Multiple links included | Multiple links included | ✓ |

### Critical Assessment

