**Verdict:** This is a strong response that meets or exceeds task requirements. The model demonstrates clear understanding of technical documentation standards, user-centric communication, and semantic versioning. The release notes are production-ready and would effectively communicate changes to diverse audiences.",,True,25720.788667007582,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,4.0,5.0,4.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
