- ✅ **TRANSFORMATION present**: A complete simplified glossary entry with metaphor (kitchen cabinet), examples (good/bad), and use-case guidance.
- ✅ **EXPERT-LEVEL present**: Kitchen metaphor is concrete and physical (cooking utensils, storage).

