  - Golden standard: Binary choice (much lower friction, higher response rate)
  - Golden standard includes detailed explanation of why this works (3 levels: deliverability, segmentation, psychology)
  - Model lacks the strategic reasoning behind the micro-interaction

## Output Quality Analysis

**Strengths of Model Response:**
- Completes all three required sections
- Newsletter is readable and functional
- Includes personalization ({{FirstName}})
- Tone is conversational
- Story arc is present (problem → solution → outcome)

