This **violates the explicit token-budget constraint** by providing a much longer analysis than requested. The instruction was to keep analysis ""extrem kompakt"" to avoid exceeding output limits.

## Output Quality Analysis

**Strengths:**
- Clear table format with three columns (Original | Verbesserung | Begründung)
