4. Doesn't address accessibility or formality considerations
5. Treats symptoms rather than root causes (no proactive prevention)

The response would be useful in a real-world scenario but doesn't meet the rigor and completeness of the golden standard. It's a **solid B-grade response** that needs refinement to reach A-grade quality.",,True,14872.161666993634,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,3.0,4.0,3.0,,hybrid,,10.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
