| Changelog | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ Equal |

---

### Critical Gaps Summary

1. **Missing Location Header (H5)** – RFC 7231 standard for 201 responses, not documented
2. **Missing Response Headers Table** – X-Request-ID, X-RateLimit-Remaining not documented
