4. Incomplete TypeScript interface (missing callbacks, types)
5. Brief justifications without real-world context
6. Less detailed prop descriptions (e.g., prop dependencies)

The response would be **acceptable for a junior developer** but **insufficient for a senior technical writer** or **component library maintainer**.",,True,23048.188707994996,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,4.0,3.0,3.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
