**Assessment:** Golden standard provides more specific, real-world examples (Gmail is a named product; the 12-field form is a concrete scenario). Model's examples are more generic (unnamed app with ""15 tabs""). Golden wins on specificity.

#### 2.4 Wann nutzen? (Use Cases & Limits)

