- ""Stell dir vor — du wachst morgens auf.""
- ""Das passiert jeden Tag — weil ein einziges Passwort einfach nicht mehr reicht.""
- ""Du kennst das schon. Online-Banking?""

**Assessment:**
- Both use conversational tone, short sentences, direct address (""du"").
- Model uses more filler words (""äh"", ""oder?"", ""Pff..."") which adds authenticity.
- Golden standard uses em-dashes (—) for dramatic pauses, which is more polished.
- Model's tone is slightly more casual/YouTube-native; golden standard is slightly more structured.
