5. **Relevant Justifications:** Each row includes reasoning (e.g., ""Funktionsbeschreibung statt Aussehen"")

### Critical Gaps vs. Golden Standard

1. **Analysis Brevity Compliance - PARTIAL:**
   - Model uses bullet points (3 bullets) instead of 3-4 sentences
