| **Word Count** | ~550 words (estimated) | ~800 words (estimated) | Model is more concise; Golden Standard is more detailed |
| **Production Cues** | Present (Music, B-Roll, Text) | More extensive and specific | Golden Standard provides richer production guidance |

**Critical Gaps in Model's Script:**
