- CTA specificity and persuasiveness
- Email body length and narrative depth
- Strategic placement and explanation of the micro-interaction
- Comprehensive justification of design choices

The response is **Good (4)** rather than **Excellent (5)** because while it meets core requirements, it lacks the polish, depth, and strategic detail of the golden standard. The CTA is the most significant weakness—it's generic rather than value-driven.",,True,17359.492042000056,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,4.0,4.0,3.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
