- Scenario 1 (car at Door 1, 1/3 chance): Stay wins, switch loses ✓
- Scenario 2 (car at Door 2, 1/3 chance): Stay loses, switch wins ✓
- Scenario 3 (car at Door 3, 1/3 chance): Correctly identified as impossible given host opened Door 3 ✓
- Final calculation: 2/3 for switching ✓

