|--------|---|---|---|
| Analysis format | Numbered list (4 items) | Bullet points (8 items) | Minor (both compact) |
| Optimization table | 3 columns (Original/Optimized/Begründung) | 4 columns (Step/Original/Optimized/Begründung) | Minor |
| Psychological principles | 4 principles with explanations | 6 principles with academic citations | Moderate |
