| Metrics table | Inline claims | Structured table | Moderate |
| CTA strategy | Mentioned | Explicitly analyzed | Minor |
| Validation caveat | Missing | Present | Minor |

### Overall Assessment

**Strengths:**
- Thorough analysis with clear problem identification
- Well-structured optimization table with concrete examples
- Good psychological reasoning (though less academically rigorous)
- Practical additional optimizations
- Mobile-first language throughout

**Weaknesses:**
