- ⚠️ The Easter Egg placement and execution are present but less integrated. The golden standard's Easter Egg (""Wer das liest: Schreib 'SICHER' in die Kommentare"") is more elegant and community-focused than the model's ""@TechMitMinistral für 10 kostenlose Backup-Codes"" (which feels promotional rather than organic).

#### **EXPERT-LEVEL Section (Step 3)**
