| **Dropdown Filter** | `aria-label=""Filter: Status auswählen""` + `aria-expanded` + `aria-haspopup=""list""` | `<label class=""sr-only"">` + `aria-expanded` + `aria-haspopup=""listbox""` (semantic HTML preferred) |
| **Search Field** | `aria-label=""Globale Suche eingeben""` + `aria-autocomplete=""list""` | `<search role=""search"">` + `.sr-only`-label + scope examples |
| **Dark Mode Toggle** | `aria-label=""Thema umschalten""` + `aria-pressed` + `aria-live=""polite""` | `aria-label=""Dunklen Modus umschalten""` + `aria-pressed` + JS implementation |
| **Pagination** | `aria-label=""Nächste Seite anzeigen""` + `aria-disabled` | `aria-label=""Nächste Seite, Seite ${current+1} von ${total}""` (dynamic) |
| **Live Ticker** | `role=""status""` + `aria-live=""assertive/polite""` | `role=""region""` + `aria-live=""polite""` + `aria-atomic=""false""` + `aria-relevant=""additions""` |

**Key Differences:**
1. **Semantic HTML preference**: Golden standard prefers `<label>` + `<search>` over `aria-label` alone
2. **Specificity**: Golden standard uses more specific `aria-haspopup=""listbox""` vs. model's `""list""`
3. **Dynamic content**: Golden standard includes template literals for pagination
4. **Granularity**: Golden standard specifies `aria-atomic=""false""` and `aria-relevant=""additions""` for live-ticker
5. **Code quality**: Golden standard provides complete, production-ready HTML; model provides suggestions

