### 2. **TRANSFORMATION Section (Step 2) – Script Quality**

**Golden Standard Expectation:**
- 400-600 words (3-5 min at 150 WPM)
- Clear timestamp markers [00:00] – [05:00]
- [PAUSE] markers for natural speech breaks
