## Comparison to Golden Standard

**Strengths of Model Response:**
- Comprehensive technical detail (Root Cause Hypothesis section with specific technical mechanisms)
- Clear structure with logical flow
- Proper severity classification (Critical)
- Includes metadata (Reporting Contact, Priority)
- Solution-oriented recommendations with immediate/follow-up actions
