- **Output Quality (3/5)**: Clear and organized, but lacks code examples and contextual depth
- **Standard Adherence (2/5)**: Identifies most errors but misses critical ones (CSRF, ID collision), lacks RFC references, no code examples, no severity-based organization

This is a **3/5 overall** — adequate but with significant gaps compared to the golden standard.",,True,20376.28650001716,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,3.0,3.0,2.0,,hybrid,0/0,10.0/10,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
