   - ⚠️ Hook is present but less refined
   - ⚠️ Story withholds some details but less strategically
   - ❌ CTA lacks the specific reason-to-click
   - ✅ PS present but less strategic

5. **Micro-Interaction with three-layer explanation:**
   - Deliverability (technical)
   - Segmentation (strategic)
   - Psychology (behavioral)
   
   Model provides:
   - ✅ Micro-interaction present
