  - Unnatural constructions: ""Schritt 1: Gehe zu den Einstellungen deines Kontos"" (too formal for conversational style)
  - Repetitive ""Okay?"" (overused)
  - Some sentences exceed 12-word limit: ""Jetzt, in der Sicherheitstaste... Aha! Genau hier!"" (awkward)

**Golden Standard:**
- Consistent ""du"" address throughout
- Short, punchy sentences: ""Stell dir vor — du wachst morgens auf.""
