- **CTA clarity:** ""Jetzt Case Study lesen – inkl. der 3 konkreten Test-Setups"" (specific promise, reason-to-click)

**Verdict:** Model's body is **too long, reveals too much detail, has tone/language issues, and lacks the clean narrative arc of the golden standard.**

