- Doesn't explain the counterintuitive nature of bringing the goat back
- No discussion of alternative solutions
- No mention of optimality (7 steps is minimal)
- Doesn't identify the goat as the ""critical"" item
- More mechanical/procedural than conceptual

## Standard Adherence

