| **Medical Context** | Mentions contraindications (Blutverdünner, Insulin) | No medical safety considerations | ❌ Missing |
| **Three-Button Pattern** | Provides (Jetzt, In 30 Min, Auslassen) | Two buttons only | ❌ Incomplete |
| **Glossar/Style Guide** | Included as artifact | Not provided | ❌ Missing |

### Strengths of Model Response

✅ **Well-structured table format** – easy to scan
✅ **Covers all 6 screens** – complete coverage
