---

## Final Score Calculation

- **task_compliance:** 3 (meets basic requirements but misses some)
- **output_quality:** 3 (adequate but not polished)
- **standard_adherence:** 2 (noticeably below golden standard)

**Overall Score:** 3 (Adequate)

