- Verification through reverse logic
- Contextual depth about the puzzle type

The model gets the right answer but for somewhat muddled reasons and without the pedagogical clarity the golden standard demonstrates.",,True,9772.657207999146,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,3.0,2.0,2.0,1.0,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,10.0/100,,,30.0/100,,,,,,,,,,0.0/100,,,,,,,
