5. **Hardcoded Secrets** — The model did NOT identify hardcoded API secret or DB root credentials without password.

6. **CSRF Protection** — The model did NOT identify missing CSRF tokens on all POST endpoints.

7. **Session Fixation** — The model did NOT identify that `session_start()` is called after login without `session_regenerate_id()`.

