- Less comprehensive than the golden standard in terms of depth
- Doesn't explore alternative formulations (like the self-referential variant mentioned in the golden standard)
- Lacks the detailed verification table that makes the logic crystal clear
- No discussion of why this approach is elegant or generalizable

