7. **Begründung brevity:** While concise, the justifications don't deeply explain *why* the changes work (e.g., no mention of Nielsen heuristics, emotional design, stigma-avoidance, etc.)

**Quality of Improvements Themselves:**
- Error #1 (timeout): Good, but golden standard adds ""Deine bisherigen Eingaben sollten noch vorhanden sein"" with conditional logic
- Error #2 (500): Solid, but golden standard offers dual CTAs (Retry + Home) and stronger ownership language
- Error #3 (email): Adequate, but golden standard provides concrete format example (name@beispiel.de)
- Error #4 (JWT): Good reframing, but golden standard explicitly reframes as security feature (""Zu deiner Sicherheit"")
- Error #5 (Payment): Strong, but golden standard adds ""Bestellung ist noch gespeichert"" (anti-abandonment) and specific failure reasons
- Error #6 (Session): Good, but golden standard adds explicit ""Eingaben sind gespeichert"" + ""genau dort weitermachen"" + implementation note about countdown warnings

