---

### 2. **Optimization Quality – Superficial Rewording**
- **Model approach:** Shortens text, adds ""Alltagssprache"" (everyday language), mentions ""Endowed Progress Effect"" once
- **Golden standard approach:** 
  - Applies 6+ psychological principles with citations (Nunes & Drèze, Kahneman, Deci & Ryan, Thaler & Sunstein, Zajonc)
  - Restructures the entire narrative flow (Wenn → Nur wenn → Dann)
  - Introduces value proposition upfront (""Lass Routinearbeit für dich erledigen"")
  - Removes all technical jargon systematically
  - Adds concrete examples in every step
  - Implements choice architecture (explicit skip button in Step 2)
  - Provides dynamic summary in Step 3 (""Wenn [Trigger], dann [Aktion]"")
  - Includes emotional closure (""🎉 Dein erster Workflow läuft!"")

**Model's Step 1 optimization:**
```
