---

## Summary of Gaps

| Criterion | Model | Golden | Gap Severity |
|-----------|-------|--------|--------------|
| Hook Quality | Generic | Provocative + Explanatory | High |
| Open Loops | Present but weak | Strategically placed with narrative tension | High |
