**Verdict:** The response is **adequate to good** but falls short of the golden standard's mastery of engagement mechanics and narrative design. It would function as a Twitter thread but would likely underperform in virality metrics compared to the golden standard.",,True,26467.32612501364,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,4.0,3.0,2.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
