  - Conclusion spans [01:01 - 01:09] AND [01:10 - 01:30] (overlapping/confusing)
  - Easter Egg section [1:30 - 1:45] appears *after* the conclusion, breaking narrative flow
  - Total script length is ~1:45, not the promised 4-5 minutes

- **Golden Standard:** 
  - Realistic timing: Hook [00:00 – 00:18] (18 seconds for emotional setup)
  - Prerequisites [00:50 – 01:10] (20 seconds, realistic)
