6. **Production cues are disconnected** – listed separately rather than embedded

The model demonstrates understanding of the *format* (timestamps, annotations, sections) but lacks the *strategic sophistication* of the golden standard (emotional pacing, viewer psychology, realistic timing, integrated production cues).",,True,33876.87537499005,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,2.0,2.0,2.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
