**Comparison to golden standard:**
The golden standard uses:
- ""den Bach runtergegangen"" (idiomatic, strong)
- ""über den Tellerrand hinausschauen"" (standard business German)
- ""ins Rollen bringen"" (more idiomatic than ""in Gang bringen"")
- ""einen Fehler zu machen"" (captures the accountability aspect)

The model's German text is noticeably weaker in idiomaticity and contains grammatical issues.

## Standard Adherence Analysis

The golden standard demonstrates:
