2. Contains grammatical errors
3. Preserves register adequately
4. **Completely violates the ""output ONLY"" instruction** by including extensive explanatory material

## Critical Issue

The most significant problem is the explicit violation of the instruction to provide ONLY the rewritten text. The model was given a clear, unambiguous directive and chose to ignore it entirely. This is a fundamental failure regardless of the quality of the German text itself.

