   - The golden standard provides **reframing strategies** (e.g., ""To protect your data"" transforms a negative into a security feature) — the model response uses empathy but not strategic reframing.

5. **CTA Strategy:** The golden standard uses **dual CTAs with Progressive Disclosure** (simplest option first). The model response provides CTAs but less strategically.

