- Schritt 2: ~400 tokens (detailed table)
- Schritt 3: ~3,500 tokens (comprehensive)
- Schritt 4: ~1,200 tokens (detailed justifications)
- **Total**: ~5,900 tokens

The model was more token-efficient but at the cost of completeness. The task instruction says ""Halte deine Problemauflistung (Schritt 1) und die Begründungen (Schritt 4) extrem kompakt"" – the model did this well, but the golden standard shows that even with detailed justifications, the final documentation (Schritt 3) can be comprehensive.

