- ✅ Includes HATEOAS `_links`
- ✅ Complete error schema with `documentation_url` and `request_id`
- ✅ Comprehensive error code reference table
- ✅ Includes business-critical fields (`shipping_address`, `payment_method`)
- ✅ Detailed retry strategy with exponential backoff
- ✅ Rate limiting headers documented

---

