**Standard Adherence (2/5)**: The response diverges significantly from the golden standard in:
- Problem count and categorization
- Type safety corrections (still has `any`)
- Documentation depth (missing accessibility, performance)
- Justification detail (3 points vs. 8 detailed points)
- Example comprehensiveness

The model produces a ""good first draft"" but falls short of the golden standard's thoroughness and precision.",,True,19406.95791700273,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,3.0,3.0,2.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
