content_transformation_003,Glossar-Eintrag Simplification,0.0,21.6/40,70.4591,0.0,⚖️ Judge: 4/5 (Hybrid),0.0,100.0,qwen3-coder:480b-cloud,e30e45586389,80.8,ollama,,,1052.0,,,60.0/60,success,Tier 1 (Undefined),2026-03-25 14:20:33,2.65,1083.0,80.8,,4.0,"## Detailed Analysis of Model Response vs. Golden Standard

### 1. ANALYSE-PHASE (Step 1)

**Model Response:**
- Provides a brief, compact analysis (3 sentences)
- Identifies key problems: Jargon, complexity, missing metaphor/examples
