        save_to_database(item)
        processed_count += 1
    else:
        log_error(f""Invalid item at {current_index}"")
    current_index += 1  # Always increment, outside the branch
```

This is cleaner because:
- It eliminates code duplication (increment appears once, not twice)
- It makes the intent clearer: ""always move to the next item""
- It's less error-prone for future modifications

The model's solution works but duplicates the increment logic.

