The response would score **3.5–4.0** on a 5-point scale. It's ""good"" in isolation but ""adequate-to-good"" when compared to the golden standard. The analysis section is the primary weakness; the optimization table is solid but lacks the depth and rigor of the reference.",,True,22363.530333008384,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,3.0,3.0,3.0,,hybrid,,10.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
