| **Berlin authenticity** | Adequate (basic informality) | Excellent (specific markers: ""wenn's nötig ist,"" ""Versprochen."") | Moderate |
| **Emotional directness** | Weak (""damit es wirklich funktioniert"") | Strong (""Versprochen."" as commitment) | Significant |
| **Stylistic distinctiveness** | Low (generic informal) | High (recognizable Berlin agency voice) | Significant |
| **Sentence structure variety** | Low (repetitive ""Wir..."") | High (varied openings, one-word sentence) | Moderate |
| **Understatement/authenticity** | Moderate (""ohne Blabla"") | Strong (""tatsächlich funktionieren,"" ""keine halben Sachen"") | Moderate |

**Key Missing Elements:**
