Comparing the model response to the golden standard:

| Phrase | Model | Golden Standard | Assessment |
|--------|-------|-----------------|------------|
| ""went south"" | ""schiefgegangen"" | ""den Bach runtergegangen"" | Model uses a weaker equivalent. ""Schiefgegangen"" is descriptive but less idiomatically authentic than the established German idiom ""den Bach runtergegangen"" |
| ""think outside the box"" | ""um die Ecke denken"" | ""über den Tellerrand hinausschauen"" | Model's choice is incorrect. ""Um die Ecke denken"" is not a standard German idiom for this concept. The golden standard's ""über den Tellerrand hinausschauen"" is the established business German equivalent |
