- Discussion of livelock risks with try-lock approach
- Practical tool recommendations (Valgrind, ThreadSanitizer, VisualVM)
- Explicit ""golden rule"" about lock ordering conventions
- Discussion of documentation and linting enforcement
- More comprehensive reasoning about why each strategy works

**What the Model Response Lacks:**

