## Comparison to Golden Standard

The golden standard provides:

1. **Detailed Problem Analysis Table** – 8 scenarios with specific, numbered problems identified (e.g., ""§ 312j BGB violation,"" ""67+ characters on mobile,"" ""Lacks empathy signal"")
