3. **Missing Elements:**
   - No per-scenario problem breakdown table
   - No expert hypotheses or psychological models
   - No discussion of when/why certain labels work better for different audiences
   - No acknowledgment of UX safety concerns (irreversible actions)
   - No character count validation
   - No legal compliance framework

---

## Quality Assessment

**Strengths:**
