- Lacks depth compared to golden standard (no psychological models, legal citations, or expert reasoning)
- No character count validation (important for mobile UX)
- Misses critical UX safety considerations (e.g., Account deletion needs modal confirmation)
- No traffic segmentation or A/B testing guidance
- No WCAG or accessibility considerations
- Doesn't acknowledge trade-offs or when multiple solutions are valid

