### 1. ANALYSIS PHASE (Schritt 1)

**Model Response:**
- Provides a brief, 3-sentence analysis identifying missing emotional anchors, Hook, and Retention-Hooks
- Correctly identifies tone issues (too technical)
- Mentions Timing-Marker and Retention-Hooks as missing
