### Evaluation Against Golden Standard

The Golden Standard is presented as the ""ideal reference output."" The Model Response is being evaluated against it.

**Strengths of Model Response:**
- Correctly identifies 11 of 15 smells
- Clear table format
- Respects token budget
- Good prioritization
- Includes expert tip

**Weaknesses of Model Response:**
- Misses 4 critical smells (Tight Coupling, Parameter-Signature-Mismatch, Temporal Coupling, Inconsistent Return Types, Missing Error Handling, Missing Default Case)
- Doesn't distinguish between code smells and actual bugs
- Doesn't identify the parameter-signature-mismatch as a correctness bug
