The model response is good but not excellent because it misses these critical diagnostic insights, particularly the queue time explanation and the emphasis on closing the measurement gap first.",,True,13470.257958979346,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,4.0,4.0,2.0,0.0,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,24.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,20.0/100,,,20.0/100,,,,,,,,,,
