   - Golden standard: Includes explicit `aria-label` and `aria-live=""polite""` specification
   - **Issue:** Model mentions barrierefreiheit but doesn't provide technical implementation details

5. **Account deletion optimization:**
   - Model: Adds ""z. B. Medikamentenpläne"" as example
   - Golden standard: Provides three distinct buttons (Konto endgültig löschen | Abbrechen) with ""Safe Default"" principle
