2. Insufficient security analysis (CSRF, RBAC, injection)
3. No refactored code example
4. Lack of RFC references and standards grounding
5. Missing architectural solutions (threading, async)",,True,16847.452000016347,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,3.0,3.0,2.0,,hybrid,0/0,10.0/10,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
