1. Explicitly identifying and resolving the apparent contradiction
2. Providing concrete architectural patterns (Event Bus, WAL, AT_LEAST_ONCE)
3. Explaining the rationale for each design decision
4. Discussing error isolation and durability guarantees
5. Identifying the critical architectural boundary that makes everything work

