- **Missing**: No explicit ""Critical"" vs ""High"" vs ""Medium"" vs ""Low"" labeling; no problem matrix; incomplete coverage (e.g., no mention of `docker-compose` vs `docker compose` V1/V2 issue, no mention of seed data, no mention of `.env.example` pattern)

