- Model says: ""Beginne mit der gesamten Informationsmenge und reduziere sie dann schrittweise"" (start with all, then reduce)
- **Correct principle:** Progressive Disclosure means showing only essentials initially, revealing advanced features on demand (not showing everything first)

This is a significant conceptual error that undermines the entire explanation.

