**Winner:** Golden standard uses proven psychological triggers (loss aversion, urgency). Model is friendly but ineffective.

#### **Spoken Word / Tonality**
- **Model:** ""Hola amigos"" (Spanish greeting in German script — inconsistent), ""Stellt sicher, dass ihr einen Stift und Papier zur Hand habt"" (irrelevant instruction). Tone is conversational but includes awkward moments (""Lieblings-Smartphone"", ""Lieblings-App"").
- **Golden Standard:** Consistent German, natural pacing (""Du bist in deinem Account. Gut.""), short sentences, direct address (""Du klickst...""). No filler or irrelevant instructions.

