## Content Quality Analysis

**Strengths of the rewritten German text itself:**
- Successfully removes toxic language (""Ninja,"" ""kill the competition,"" ""dominate"")
- Eliminates gender bias by using ""Fachkraft"" (gender-neutral) instead of ""Handwerker"" (masculine)
- Removes the ""manly courage"" requirement and ""work-hard-play-hard"" stereotype
- Uses professional, inclusive language appropriate for German job postings
