| Props table rows | 9 (all props documented) | 2 (only data, columns) | -7 props, 78% incomplete |
| Code examples | 3 (complete, realistic) | 0 | -3 examples, 100% missing |
| Interface corrections | Full (JSDoc, fixed types, new callbacks) | Minimal (repeated original) | No type safety improvements |
| Documentation sections | 8+ (Quick Start, A11y, Performance, etc.) | 1 (props table only) | -7 sections |
| Justification depth | Detailed per-problem reasoning | Generic platitudes | Superficial |

