   - [00:00-00:05] has a hook with music cue
   - [00:05-00:15] attempts an explanation
   - [00:15-00:25] mentions prerequisites
   
   Then the script **completely degenerates**:
   - Timestamps become nonsensical: `[000]` instead of `[00:00]`
