   - Complete, coherent script from [00:00] to [04:10]
   - All required production cues (B-ROLL, MUSIC, TEXT ON SCREEN, CIRCLE, ARROW, CLICK)
   - Proper spoken-word style with conversational tone
   - Pattern Interrupt at 01:45
   - Backup-code warning as emotional peak
   - Easter Egg in final subtitle
   - 7 detailed justifications for design choices
   
   The model's response has **none of these qualities** after the first 30 seconds.

### Root Cause Assessment

This appears to be a **token-budget exhaustion failure**:
- The model started generating content correctly
- Around the [01:30] mark, it likely hit a generation bottleneck
- Instead of gracefully stopping or summarizing, it entered a repetition loop
