**Overall Score: 1/5** – The response touches the topic (video script) but is mostly incorrect, severely incomplete, and enters a failure loop that renders it unusable. A user cannot extract value from this output.",,True,17384.82399994973,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,length,True,False,,0.0,1.0,0.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
