### Email Body Issues:
- **Tone problems**: ""Kennt ihr das Problem?"" and ""So ging es uns bei Company X nicht anders"" – confusing first-person perspective (who is ""us""?)
- **Narrative clarity**: ""Nach einer langen Suche nach der perfekten Kombination von Sales-Boost, hat sich das E-Commerce-Startup Company X mit ihrem neuen Framework bewiesen"" – grammatically awkward and unclear
- **Missing emotional arc**: No clear Problem → Solution → Outcome progression
- **Weak storytelling**: Jumps between ideas without building tension
- **Insufficient word count**: Appears to be ~150 words (requirement: 200-300)
- **CTA weakness**: ""Klickt hier für die volle Story"" is generic and lacks reason-to-click (golden standard: ""Jetzt Case Study lesen – inkl. der 3 konkreten Test-Setups"")
- **Bullet points**: Used but not optimally integrated into narrative flow

### PS Quality:
