| Word count (200-300) | ❌ ~150 | ✅ 247 | Moderate |
| CTA specificity | ⚠️ Generic | ✅ Includes concrete benefit promise | Moderate |
| Micro-interaction | ❌ Missing | ✅ Reply mechanism detailed | Critical |
| Deliverability explanation | ❌ Missing | ✅ Three-layer explanation | Critical |
| Segmentation strategy | ❌ Missing | ✅ Testing vs. Bauchgefühl segments | Critical |

