- Pronoun consistency (major)
- Grammatical naturalness (moderate)
- Signature formatting (minor)

The model only partially adheres to the provided golden standard, missing approximately 40% of the required conversions.",,True,9925.975500023924,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,2.0,2.0,2.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,60/100,60/100
