- `rm -rf`, `docker system prune`, `swarmui/swarmui`, `mcr.microsoft.com`

### Evaluation of Model Response

**Positive aspects:**
1. ✅ Uses `docker compose up -d` (correct command, though `-d` is detached mode)
2. ✅ Includes correct image: `ghcr.io/mcmonkeyprojects/swarmui:latest`
