- Explicit statement of assumptions
- Intuitive explanation of the paradox
- Detailed calculation walkthrough
- Discussion of real-world considerations
- Deeper confidence justification",,True,11153.866791981272,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,4.0,4.0,3.0,1.0,hybrid,,,,,,,,30.0/100,,15.0/100,25.0/100,,0.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
