  - No API migration details
  - No admin handoff instructions for JWT rotation
  - No severity levels for security issues
  - Links are placeholders `[Link zur Anleitung]`
  - No detailed feature explanations
  - No code examples or concrete use cases
  - Contributor list is empty placeholder

**Golden Standard:**
- Comprehensive structure with:
