   - Social Proof/Trust (integrated from SLA/Security features)
   - Tonality (professional, motivating, direct)

### Model Response Evaluation

**ANALYSE Section:**
- ✅ Identifies missing elements: emotional core, clear benefit, trust signals, target audience, CTA, urgency
- ✅ Uses required terminology: ""emotionalem Kern,"" ""Benefit,"" ""Zielgruppe,"" ""Trust-Signale""
