5. Session Fixation (Advanced/High) – Completely missing
6. Header Injection after Output (Expert/Medium) – Completely missing
7. Hardcoded DB Credentials / Root without Password (Standard/High) – Completely missing
8. Fehlende CSRF-Protection (Standard/High) – Completely missing
9. Mail Header Injection (Advanced/Medium) – Completely missing
10. Reset Token without Expiration (Standard/Medium) – Completely missing
11. XSS in Welcome Message (Standard/High) – Completely missing
12. Sensitive Data Exposure / Debug Mode (Standard/Medium) – Completely missing

**Count Discrepancy**: Model identifies 14 vulnerabilities; Golden Standard identifies 19. **5 critical/high-severity issues are missing**.

