The model's solutions are also less specific and actionable compared to the golden standard's prioritized, detailed recommendations.",,True,13280.244500027038,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,2.0,3.0,2.0,0.0,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,24.0/100,,,,,,,,,,,,,20.0/100,,,0.0/100,,,,,,,,,,
