2. **Quality Issues:** Less sophisticated hook, weaker open loops, less optimized engagement design
3. **Strengths:** Includes all major arguments, statistics, case study, and basic engagement elements

The response would be **functional but flawed** if character counts were corrected. As submitted, it violates a hard technical constraint.",,True,22237.574708997272,anthropic,claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,stop,False,False,,2.0,3.0,2.0,,hybrid,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
