5. **""Fachkraft"" vs. ""Person""**: The golden standard uses the established German term ""Fachkraft"" (skilled worker/professional), which is more idiomatic and specific. The model uses the more generic ""Person.""

## Accuracy Assessment

Both responses are factually accurate German translations. No grammatical errors are present in the model response. The vocabulary choices are appropriate and professional.

## Standard Adherence

