- Does not provide a verification table or visual summary
- Lacks discussion of *why* this approach is elegant or generalizable
- Does not explain the underlying principle (self-referential questions creating double inversion)
- No discussion of alternative strategies or why they fail

**Golden Standard Strengths:**
- Provides comprehensive verification with a clear table
- Explains the ""double inversion"" principle explicitly
- Offers alternative formulations (""What would I say if I asked myself..."")
- Discusses the elegance and robustness of the solution
- Explains why the solution works in general terms
- Provides deeper pedagogical insight into the problem structure

### Clarity and Organization

**Model Response:**
- Clear logical flow
- Good use of mathematical notation
- Straightforward presentation
- Somewhat dense but readable

**Golden Standard:**
